<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"><title>Paper A · Learner paper</title><base href="/api/v1/course-tests/chinese-1/a/file/"><link rel="stylesheet" href="paper.css"></head><body><main><header class="hero"><p class="eyebrow">HSKKit · Chinese 1 Course Review · Original Paper A</p><h1>Paper A · Learner paper</h1><p>40 listening/reading questions + 4 writing/speaking tasks. Independent course-review draft.</p><p class="note">Printable materials and answer references. Open the workspace to practise with section clocks and local recording. Writing and speaking need manual review.</p><nav class="links"><a href="index.html">Overview</a><a href="student.html">Learner paper</a><a href="teacher.html">Answers &amp; scripts</a><a href="listening.html">Listen to Paper A</a><a href="student.pdf">Learner PDF</a><a href="student-traditional.pdf">繁體 PDF</a><a href="teacher.pdf">Answer PDF</a></nav></header><nav class="links"><a href="#listening">Listening</a><a href="#reading">Reading</a><a href="#writing">Writing</a><a href="#speaking">Speaking</a></nav><h2 class="sectiontitle" id="listening">Listening · 15 minutes</h2><h3>L1 · Questions 1–5</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q1"><h3>1. How old is Wang Ming?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m01.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 十六岁</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 十七岁</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 十九岁</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q2"><h3>2. What does the speaker’s mother do?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m02.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 医生</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 老师</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 学生</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q3"><h3>3. Who is fifteen years old?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m03.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 弟弟</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 哥哥</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 妹妹</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q4"><h3>4. Where is Li An from?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m04.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 中国</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 韩国</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 美国</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q5"><h3>5. Where is the speaker waiting?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m05.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 家门口</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 商店门口</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 学校门口</div></div></article></div><h3>L2 · Questions 6–10</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q6"><h3>6. What does the boy need for class?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m06.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 铅笔</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 钢笔</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 尺子</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q7"><h3>7. Which book does the boy want to borrow?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m07.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 英语书</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 数学书</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 中文书</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q8"><h3>8. Which classroom should the girl go to?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m08.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 二楼201</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 三楼302</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 四楼402</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q9"><h3>9. What will the girl do first after class?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m09.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 借书</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 吃饭</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 买衣服</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q10"><h3>10. When does today’s Chinese class begin?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m10.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 九点</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 十点半</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 九点半</div></div></article></div><h3>L3 · Questions 11–15</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q11"><h3>11. What does the girl want to eat now?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m11.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 面条</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 米饭和鸡蛋</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 米饭和肉</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q12"><h3>12. What does the speaker drink every morning?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m12.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 牛奶</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 茶</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 咖啡</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q13"><h3>13. How many apples does the boy want?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m13.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 两个</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 六个</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 四个</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q14"><h3>14. How much does the lunch cost?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m14.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 二十块</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 十二块</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 八块</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q15"><h3>15. Which color does the boy choose?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m15.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 蓝色</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 红色</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 白色</div></div></article></div><h3>L4 · Questions 16–20</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q16"><h3>16. When will they meet?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m16.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 星期六上午</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 星期六下午</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 星期天下午</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q17"><h3>17. When does the boy leave home?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m17.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 六点半</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 七点半</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 七点</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q18"><h3>18. What will the girl wear?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m18.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 厚外套</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 薄衣服</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 短裤</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q19"><h3>19. What do they agree to do?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m19.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 打篮球</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 去公园</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 看电视</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q20"><h3>20. What will the girl do on Saturday afternoon?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m20.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 画画</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 听音乐</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 唱歌</div></div></article></div><h2 class="sectiontitle" id="reading">Reading · 20 minutes</h2><h3>R1 · Questions 21–25</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q21"><h3>21. Where is Jin Na from?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">新同学：金娜<br>年龄：十六岁<br>来自：韩国<br>学校：明华学校<br>家人：爸爸、妈妈、弟弟<br>爱好：听音乐</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 中国</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 美国</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 韩国</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q22"><h3>22. Who studies at university?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">小雨，你好！我爸爸在学校教中文，妈妈在医院工作，是医生。我哥哥在大学读书。我还在中学上学。<br>王宁</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 爸爸</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 哥哥</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 妈妈</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q23"><h3>23. How old is the younger sister?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">照片上是我和妹妹。我今年十六岁，妹妹十二岁。她喜欢红色，我喜欢蓝色。我们星期天常常一起去公园。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 十二岁</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 十六岁</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 十四岁</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q24"><h3>24. Who lives with Anna in Beijing?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">你好，我是安娜。我现在和爸爸妈妈住在北京。哥哥在上海工作，不和我们一起住。我们星期日晚上给哥哥打电话。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 哥哥</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 爷爷奶奶</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 爸爸妈妈</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q25"><h3>25. Which class is Lin Ming joining?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">新同学林明：<br>欢迎来二班！我们在三楼302教室上课。请带中文书。今天九点上课，老师姓王。<br>二班班长 小李</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 一班</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 二班</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 三班</div></div></article></div><h3>R2 · Questions 26–30</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q26"><h3>26. Which item do students NOT need to bring?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">同学们：<br>明天有画画课，请带铅笔和彩色笔。老师有纸，大家不用带纸。书包请放在桌子下面。<br>刘老师</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 纸</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 铅笔</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 彩色笔</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q27"><h3>27. Which lesson starts at ten o’clock?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">星期二上午课表<br>中文：9:00—9:40<br>英语：10:00—10:40<br>数学：11:00—11:40<br>请在上课前到教室。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 中文</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 数学</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 英语</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q28"><h3>28. Where should Xiao Chen collect the book?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">小陈：<br>你的书我看完了。今天下课后我把书放在王老师的桌子上。请你去办公室拿，不用来我们教室。<br>小周</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 小周的教室</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 办公室</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 图书馆</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q29"><h3>29. What does Li Xiaowen ask to borrow?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">老师：<br>我的中文书在家里，英语书在书包里。今天能借您的中文书用一下吗？下课后我就还给您。<br>李小文</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 英语书</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 书包</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 中文书</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q30"><h3>30. When does Xiao Lin play basketball?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">小林的一周<br>星期一下午：在学校打篮球<br>星期三下午：在图书馆看书<br>星期六上午：和妈妈买水果<br>星期天：在家休息</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 星期一下午</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 星期三下午</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 星期六上午</div></div></article></div><h3>R3 · Questions 31–35</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q31"><h3>31. How much are the noodles?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">学校食堂菜单<br>米饭：四元<br>面条：六元<br>鸡蛋：两元<br>牛奶：五元<br>中午十一点开始卖，下午一点结束。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 四元</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 六元</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 五元</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q32"><h3>32. What does Xiao An want for lunch?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">妈妈：<br>今天午饭我想吃米饭和鸡蛋，不要肉。妹妹想吃面条。请再给我买一瓶水，谢谢！我十二点回家。<br>小安</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 米饭和鸡蛋</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 面条</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 米饭和肉</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q33"><h3>33. What should Dad buy TWO of?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">爸爸：<br>家里还有三个苹果，今天不用买苹果。请买两个香蕉和四个橙子。香蕉给妹妹，橙子我们一起吃。<br>小美</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 苹果</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 橙子</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 香蕉</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q34"><h3>34. What drink does Xiaowen request?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">小李：<br>今天有点儿冷，我不想喝冷水。请给我一杯热茶，不加糖。你的咖啡在桌子上。我在教室等你。<br>小文</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 冷水</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 热茶</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 咖啡</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q35"><h3>35. Which shirt does the writer want?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">小青：<br>商店里有蓝色和白色的衬衫。我喜欢蓝色的，要小号。白色那件太大了，我不买。请你帮我看看蓝色小号多少钱。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 白色大号</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 蓝色大号</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 蓝色小号</div></div></article></div><h3>R4 · Questions 36–40</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q36"><h3>36. When do they finally agree to meet?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">小白：周六上午来我家，好吗？<br>小林：周六我有课。周日上午九点可以吗？<br>小白：可以，我九点在家等你。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 周日上午九点</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 周六上午九点</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 周日上午十点</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q37"><h3>37. When does the writer take the bus?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">我的早上<br>六点起床，六点半吃早饭，七点坐公共汽车去学校。八点开始上课。爸爸七点半出门去工作。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 六点半</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 七点半</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 七点</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q38"><h3>38. Which item of clothing should Xiaoyu take from home?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">小雨：<br>今天很热。去公园时请带帽子和水，不用带厚外套。你的蓝帽子在门口，白帽子在学校。<br>妈妈</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 厚外套</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 蓝帽子</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 白帽子</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q39"><h3>39. What will they do together on Sunday afternoon?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">小周：周日下午一起去看电影吗？<br>小陈：好啊！我上午要打篮球，下午有空。<br>小周：那我们两点在电影院门口见。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 看电影</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 打篮球</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 在家看书</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q40"><h3>40. Which activity fits Xiaohong’s preference and free time?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">学校活动<br>画画：星期二下午，王老师教。<br>唱歌：星期四下午，刘老师教。<br>小红喜欢画画，不喜欢唱歌。她周二下午有空。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 星期四唱歌</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 星期二画画</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 星期二唱歌</div></div></article></div><h2 class="sectiontitle" id="writing">Writing · 15 minutes</h2><p>Both tasks share 15 minutes. Write on paper or in your own text editor. This review page does not save answers.</p><section class="box" id="W1"><p class="eyebrow">writing · W1</p><h2>Reply to an invitation</h2><p>Your classmate sent the message below. Reply in Chinese. Say whether you can come on Saturday, give a time or another day that works for you, and ask one relevant question. You may invent personal details. About 20-40 Chinese characters is a guide, not a minimum.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">小林：你好！星期六来我家吃午饭，好吗？你想吃米饭还是面条？你几点有空？<br>小周</p></div><ul><li>Respond to the Saturday invitation.</li><li>Give a workable time or suggest another day.</li><li>Ask one question related to the visit.</li></ul><p class="badge">Manual /8 · no automatic grade</p><p class="note">Missing responses stay unsubmitted; technical failures need rerecording. Suggested length is not a hard minimum.</p></section><section class="box" id="W2"><p class="eyebrow">writing · W2</p><h2>Introduce a student</h2><p>Use the fictional profile below to introduce Lin An in Chinese. Include the person’s name and age, school and class starting time, and at least one preference. Write connected simple sentences. About 40-70 Chinese characters is a guide, not a minimum. Do not substitute your own private information.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">姓名：林安<br>年龄：十六岁<br>学校：明华学校<br>上课：上午九点<br>喜欢：画画、米饭<br>不喜欢：咖啡</p></div><ul><li>Identify Lin An by name and age.</li><li>Give the school and the class starting time.</li><li>State at least one preference consistently with the card.</li></ul><p class="badge">Manual /8 · no automatic grade</p><p class="note">Missing responses stay unsubmitted; technical failures need rerecording. Suggested length is not a hard minimum.</p></section><h2 class="sectiontitle" id="speaking">Speaking · 10 minutes</h2><section class="box" id="S1"><p class="eyebrow">speaking · S1</p><h2>Meet a classmate</h2><p>Respond in Chinese to four recorded prompts. Each prompt plays twice, followed by 10 seconds to prepare and up to 20 seconds to record. Use real or invented information. The four responses form ONE task, reviewed together out of eight. These are fixed prompts, not an adaptive conversation.</p><p>A new classmate asks about you and proposes an activity. Listen to the questions rather than reading their transcripts.</p><h3>Prompt S1-1</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-1.mp3"></audio><h3>Prompt S1-2</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-2.mp3"></audio><h3>Prompt S1-3</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-3.mp3"></audio><h3>Prompt S1-4</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-4.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Each audio prompt plays twice. After it ends, allow 10 seconds to prepare and 20 seconds to record using your own recording app. Four responses = one task /8.</p><p class="badge">Manual /8 · no automatic grade</p><p class="note">Missing responses stay unsubmitted; technical failures need rerecording. Suggested length is not a hard minimum.</p></section><section class="box" id="S2"><p class="eyebrow">speaking · S2</p><h2>Tell a classmate about a school day</h2><p>Introduce the fictional student’s day in Chinese using the card. Include who the student is, when and where the student studies, and one after-school activity. You have 60 seconds to prepare and up to 60 seconds to speak. Simple sentences are enough; no minimum recording length is enforced.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">姓名：王宁<br>学校：明华学校<br>八点：在学校上课<br>十二点：吃午饭<br>下午三点：下课<br>下课后：去公园走走</p></div><ul><li>Identify Wang Ning.</li><li>Give the school and at least one class time from the card.</li><li>Describe the after-school activity.</li></ul><p class="badge">Manual /8 · no automatic grade</p><p class="note">Missing responses stay unsubmitted; technical failures need rerecording. Suggested length is not a hard minimum.</p></section></main></body></html>